1
00:00:08,013 --> 00:00:10,063
Ava, the bodyguard should be at your door by now.

2
00:00:10,113 --> 00:00:10,663
Someone's here.

3
00:00:10,763 --> 00:00:12,313
Ryan... did my father send you?

4
00:00:15,769 --> 00:00:16,969
Stay behind me.

5
00:00:18,869 --> 00:00:20,769
Ryan, what's going on?

6
00:00:21,469 --> 00:00:23,369
Your father didn't send me to babysit you.

7
00:00:23,769 --> 00:00:25,269
Someone wants you gone.

8
00:00:37,702 --> 00:00:40,302
Ava. Take my hand. We're leaving.

9
00:00:49,186 --> 00:00:50,986
Three years. Not one call.

10
00:00:51,186 --> 00:00:52,386
And now you show up with a gun?

11
00:00:52,586 --> 00:00:53,786
You can hate me later.

12
00:00:53,986 --> 00:00:55,686
Right now, you stay alive.

13
00:01:02,958 --> 00:01:04,758
You left me at the altar.

14
00:01:05,558 --> 00:01:06,958
I had my reasons.

15
00:01:07,458 --> 00:01:08,658
Then tell me.

16
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:16,530
Ava... will you marry me?

17
00:01:16,730 --> 00:01:18,830
Yes. Yes!

18
00:01:31,102 --> 00:01:32,402
Don't move.

19
00:01:36,502 --> 00:01:38,102
I've seen that symbol before...

20
00:01:39,202 --> 00:01:39,802
Where?

21
00:01:40,202 --> 00:01:40,902
Run!

22
00:01:48,074 --> 00:01:50,074
Daniel? I'm okay...

23
00:01:50,174 --> 00:01:52,174
Where are you, Ava? Tell me exactly where you are.

24
00:01:52,974 --> 00:01:54,674
What are you doing?! That's my fiancé!

25
00:01:55,074 --> 00:01:56,774
That's how they found you.

26
00:01:59,746 --> 00:02:02,346
Daniel would never hurt me. He loves me.

27
00:02:02,646 --> 00:02:05,146
Then how did he know where you were... before I did?

28
00:02:10,246 --> 00:02:11,346
Hold on.

29
00:02:17,118 --> 00:02:18,618
Ryan!

30
00:02:19,318 --> 00:02:21,618
I see them.

31
00:02:27,790 --> 00:02:29,190
You're bleeding.

32
00:02:29,890 --> 00:02:31,090
I've had worse.

33
00:02:49,424 --> 00:02:52,424
Find her. And bring me the necklace.
